 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.78,
   "text": "What would happen if the Earth and all terrestrial objects suddenly stopped spinning, but the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 3.78,
   "end": 5.14,
   "text": "atmosphere retained its velocity?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 5.82,
   "end": 7.42,
   "text": "Well, first nearly everyone would die.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 7.84,
   "end": 9.1,
   "text": "Then things would get interesting.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 9.42,
   "end": 13.44,
   "text": "At the equator, the Earth's surface is moving at about 470 meters per second, a little over",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 13.44,
   "end": 15.42,
   "text": "a thousand miles an hour, relative to its axis.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 15.8,
   "end": 19.38,
   "text": "If the Earth stops and the air doesn't, the air there will suddenly be moving over the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 19.38,
   "end": 21.34,
   "text": "surface at 470 meters per second.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 21.62,
   "end": 24.6,
   "text": "For reference, supersonic speed is 343 meters per second.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 24.9,
   "end": 28.26,
   "text": "The wind would be highest at the equator, but everyone and everything living between",
   "avg_logprob": -0.153,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 28.26,
   "end": 32.78,
   "text": "42 degrees north and 42 degrees south, which includes about 85% of the world's population,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 33.04,
   "end": 35.12,
   "text": "would also experience sudden supersonic winds.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 35.52,
   "end": 38.78,
   "text": "The high winds would only last for a few minutes near the surface before friction with the",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 38.78,
   "end": 42.36,
   "text": "ground slowed them down, however those few minutes would be long enough to reduce virtually",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 42.36,
   "end": 43.9,
   "text": "all human structures to ruins.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 44.48,
   "end": 47.3,
   "text": "Even structures strong enough to survive the winds themselves would be in trouble.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 47.6,
   "end": 50.3,
   "text": "Say you're in a massive bunker made out of some material which can withstand",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 50.3,
   "end": 51.6,
   "text": "a thousand mile per hour winds.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 52.0,
   "end": 54.88,
   "text": "Unfortunately, you probably have neighbors, and if the neighbor upwind of you has a",
   "avg_logprob": -0.122,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.016
  },
  {
   "start": 54.88,
   "end": 58.8,
   "text": "less well-anchored bunker, your bunker will have to withstand a supersonic impact by their",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 58.8,
   "end": 59.18,
   "text": "bunker.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 59.66,
   "end": 63.42,
   "text": "My home in Boston is far enough north to be just barely outside the supersonic wind zone,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 63.72,
   "end": 66.46,
   "text": "but no human cities are far enough from the equator to escape devastation.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 67.14,
   "end": 68.84,
   "text": "Even so, the human race wouldn't go extinct.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 69.42,
   "end": 72.94,
   "text": "True, very few people above the surface would survive, however a lot of people below",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  },
  {
   "start": 72.94,
   "end": 75.42,
   "text": "the surface of the ground would survive the initial event just fine.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.141,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.516
  }
 ],
